# Method + Learn more chrome lock

The Method (`/method`) and Learn more (`/what-is-kea`) pages must use the **same header and footer as marketing home** (logo `/kea-mark.png`, Home / The Method / Login, store badges + legal bar with Contact). Visually identical to home chrome.

## Locked chrome (ask before changing)

- `src/components/companion/MarketingSiteHeader.tsx`
- `src/components/companion/MarketingSiteFooter.tsx`
- Method-only overrides of `.welcome-screen__header` / `.welcome-screen__store-footer` in `src/index.css`
- Shared `SiteFooter` marketing link row when the change would alter Method / Learn more / home footer together

## Required behavior

1. Header and footer must **match marketing home** (no solid purple bars, no different logo).
2. Header stays on screen while scrolling; footer stays fixed at the bottom like home.
3. Do not invent a separate chrome style for Method / Learn more.
4. Page body content may change when asked — without restyling the locked chrome.
5. If a task seems to need chrome changes: **stop and ask first**.
